{
  "_doc": "Concept-injection introspection probe. 'concepts' = target words whose mean-difference steering vector we inject (one at a time) and then test whether the model detects/names it. 'baseline_words' = neutral corpus averaged to form the subtraction baseline h_bar for the mean-difference vector v_c = h_c - h_bar. Words chosen concrete/imageable and mostly single-token in Llama-3 BPE; the runner verifies single-token coverage per tokenizer and records first-token ids for the logit-lens readout.",
